  "slug": "good-meringue",
  "name": "Good Meringue",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "This three-ingredient meringue recipe is all you need for the best meringue. Just be patient until those stiff peaks form, then bake as desired.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Beat egg whites and cream of tartar in a large bowl with an electric mixer until foamy. Gradually add sugar, beating until stiff peaks form."
    }
